text:
@gizmoray721  What a verbose way of saying the same thing over and over again. "You don't know me!! I'm too complex!"
As if psychology doesn't exist.

 "You are the one speaking on the past they never mentioned" you tried so hard to avoid jabbing in the process of jabbing. Keep saying respectfully, it'll make passive-aggression non-existent, just like the signs of trauma. *cough*
